{"tool_name":"webscst","contents":["oeb","bioschemas","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"webscst","home":"http://www.webscst.com","summary":"An interactive web application for single-cell RNA-sequencing data and spatial transcriptomic data integration.","addition_date":"2022-08-10T23:10:45.969382Z","last_update_date":"2024-11-24T15:50:31.734313Z","tool_type":["Web application"],"accessibility":"Open access","biotools_curie":"biotools:webscst","cost":"Free of charge","credit":[{"email":"zouquan@nclab.net","name":"Quan Zou","orcidid":"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6406-1142","typeEntity":"Person"},{"name":"Chen Cao","orcidid":"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5343-808X"},{"name":"Feifei Cui","orcidid":"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7055-3813"},{"name":"Lijun Dou","orcidid":"https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3617-3416"},{"name":"Zilong Zhang","orcidid":"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4934-1258"}],"edit_permission":{"type":"private"},"function":[{"input":[{"data":{"term":"Cell type name","uri":"http://edamontology.org/data_2892"}},{"data":{"term":"Gene expression matrix","uri":"http://edamontology.org/data_3112"},"format":[{"term":"MTX","uri":"http://edamontology.org/format_3916"}]},{"data":{"term":"Gene name","uri":"http://edamontology.org/data_2299"},"format":[{"term":"TSV","uri":"http://edamontology.org/format_3475"}]}],"operation":[{"term":"Gene expression profiling","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_0314"},{"term":"Standardisation and normalisation","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3435"}]}],"name":"webSCST","operating_system":["Linux","Mac","Windows"],"owner":"Jennifer","publication":[{"doi":"10.1093/bioinformatics/btac350","metadata":{"abstract":"Summary: Integrative analysis of single-cell RNA-sequencing (scRNA-seq) data with spatial data for the same species and organ would provide each cell sample with a predictive spatial location, which would facilitate biological study. However, publicly available spatial sequencing datasets for specific species and organs are rare and are often displayed in different formats. In this study, we introduce a new web-based scRNA-seq analysis tool, webSCST, that integrates well-organized spatial transcriptome sequencing datasets categorized by species and organs, provides a user-friendly interface for raw single-cell processing with popular integration methods and allows users to submit their raw scRNA-seq data once to obtain predicted spatial locations for each cell type.","authors":[{"name":"Cao C."},{"name":"Cui F."},{"name":"Dou L."},{"name":"Su W."},{"name":"Xu A."},{"name":"Zhang Z."},{"name":"Zou Q."}],"citationCount":21,"date":"2022-07-01T00:00:00Z","journal":"Bioinformatics","title":"WebSCST: An interactive web application for single-cell RNA-sequencing data and spatial transcriptomic data integration"},"pmid":"35604082"}],"topic":[{"term":"Cell biology","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_2229"},{"term":"Model organisms","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0621"},{"term":"RNA-Seq","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_3170"},{"term":"Transcriptomics","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_3308"},{"term":"Workflows","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0769"}],"validated":1},"bioschemas":{"name":"webSCST","home":"https://bio.tools/webscst","summary":"An interactive web application for single-cell RNA-sequencing data and spatial transcriptomic data integration.","tool_type":"sc:SoftwareApplication"},"oeb":{"metrics":[{"@id":"https://openebench.bsc.es/monitor/metrics/biotools:webscst/web/www.webscst.com","@license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","@nmsp":"biotools","@type":"metrics","deprecated":true,"distribution":{"sourcecode":{"interpreted":true}},"project":{"build":{},"deployment":{},"publications":[{"entries":[{"cit_count":17,"citations":[{"count":3,"year":"2023"},{"count":4,"year":"2025"},{"count":5,"year":"2024"},{"count":5,"year":"2026"}],"doi":"10.1093/bioinformatics/btac350","pmid":"35604082","ref_count":0,"refs":[],"title":"webSCST: an interacti